<!--
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
PATTERN: Toolbar and Menubar Patterns - Complete Guide
SOURCE: axelor-open-suite/axelor-account/Invoice.xml + axelor-sale/SaleOrder.xml + axelor-production/ManufOrder.xml
BEST PRACTICE: Organizing primary and secondary actions in grids and forms
CONTEXT: Toolbar for prominent actions, Menubar for grouped/batch operations
KEY PATTERNS:
- Toolbar with single/multiple buttons
- Menubar with nested menu structure
- Combining toolbar and menubar
- Menu items with prompts
- Conditional menu items (if, if-module, showIf)
- Action chaining in toolbar buttons
- Icon usage and positioning
- showTitle for menu labels
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-->
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<object-views xmlns="http://axelor.com/xml/ns/object-views"
  xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
  xsi:schemaLocation="http://axelor.com/xml/ns/object-views
  https://axelor.com/xml/ns/object-views/object-views_7.4.xsd">

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- PATTERN 1: Simple Toolbar in Grid (Single Button) -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <grid name="manuf-order-grid-simple" title="Manufacturing orders"
        model="com.axelor.apps.production.db.ManufOrder">

    <!-- PATTERN: Single primary action in toolbar -->
    <toolbar>
      <button name="mergeBtn" title="Merge manufacturing orders" icon="fa-code-fork"
              onClick="action-manuf-order-group-merge"/>
    </toolbar>

    <field name="manufOrderSeq"/>
    <field name="product"/>
    <field name="statusSelect"/>

  </grid>

  <!--
  EXPLANATION:
  - Toolbar: Horizontal bar at top of grid
  - Single most important action (print, export, merge, create)
  - Button attributes:
    - name: Unique identifier
    - title: Display text (or use title attribute for tooltip if no text)
    - icon: Font Awesome icon (fa-*)
    - onClick: Action or action chain
  -->


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- PATTERN 2: Toolbar with Multiple Buttons -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <grid name="sale-order-grid-toolbar" title="Sale orders"
        model="com.axelor.apps.sale.db.SaleOrder">

    <!-- PATTERN: Multiple related actions in toolbar -->
    <toolbar>
      <button name="printBtn" title="Print sale orders" icon="fa-print"
              onClick="action-sale-order-method-show-sale-order"/>

      <button name="exportBtn" title="Export to Excel" icon="fa-file-excel-o"
              onClick="action-sale-order-method-export-excel"/>

      <button name="emailBtn" title="Send by email" icon="fa-envelope"
              onClick="action-send-by-email-with-template"/>
    </toolbar>

    <field name="saleOrderSeq"/>
    <field name="partner"/>
    <field name="statusSelect"/>
    <field name="inTaxTotal"/>

  </grid>

  <!--
  BEST PRACTICE:
  - Limit to 2-4 buttons (avoid clutter)
  - Left-to-right priority (most important first)
  - Use icons that convey action clearly
  - Common toolbar actions: Print, Export, Email, Create
  -->


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- PATTERN 3: Simple Menubar in Grid (Single Menu) -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <grid name="sale-order-grid-menubar" title="Sale orders"
        model="com.axelor.apps.sale.db.SaleOrder">

    <!-- PATTERN: Single menu with multiple items -->
    <menubar>
      <menu name="saleOrderToolsMenu" title="Tools" icon="fa-wrench" showTitle="true">
        <item name="seeSaleOrderLinesItem" title="See sale orders lines"
              action="action-view-open-sale-order-lines"/>

        <item name="computeMarginsItem" title="Compute margins"
              action="action-sale-order-method-compute-margins"/>

        <item name="generateReportItem" title="Generate analysis report"
              action="action-sale-order-method-generate-report"/>
      </menu>
    </menubar>

    <field name="saleOrderSeq"/>
    <field name="partner"/>
    <field name="statusSelect"/>

  </grid>

  <!--
  EXPLANATION:
  - Menubar: Dropdown menus for secondary actions
  - Menu attributes:
    - name: Unique identifier
    - title: Display text
    - icon: Font Awesome icon
    - showTitle: true (show text + icon) or false (icon only)
  - Item attributes:
    - name: Unique identifier (optional)
    - title: Display text
    - action: Action to execute
  -->


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- PATTERN 4: Toolbar + Menubar Combined (Grid) -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <grid name="invoice-grid-combined" title="Invoices"
        model="com.axelor.apps.account.db.Invoice"
        orderBy="-invoiceDate">

    <!-- PATTERN: Toolbar for primary action -->
    <toolbar>
      <button name="printBtn" title="Print invoices"
              onClick="action-invoice-method-show-invoice" icon="fa-print"/>
    </toolbar>

    <!-- PATTERN: Menubar for batch/tool actions -->
    <menubar>
      <menu name="invoiceToolsMenu" title="Tools" icon="fa-wrench" showTitle="true">
        <!-- PATTERN: Item with confirmation prompt -->
        <item name="validateSelectedInvoicesItem"
              title="Validate selected invoices"
              action="action-invoice-method-mass-validation"
              prompt="Are you sure you want to validate all selected invoices ?"/>

        <!-- PATTERN: Item with conditional visibility -->
        <item name="ventilateSelectedInvoicesItem"
              title="Ventilate selected invoices"
              action="action-invoice-method-mass-ventilation"
              prompt="Are you sure you want to ventilate all selected invoices ?"
              if="!__config__.app.getApp('invoice')?.isVentilationSkipped"/>

        <item name="mergeCustInvoicesItem"
              title="Merge Cust. Invoices"
              action="action-invoice-method-convert-selected-lines-to-merge-lines"/>

        <item name="seeCustInvoicesLinesItem"
              title="See cust. invoices lines"
              action="action-customer-invoice-line-menu"/>
      </menu>
    </menubar>

    <field name="invoiceId"/>
    <field name="partner"/>
    <field name="invoiceDate"/>
    <field name="statusSelect"/>
    <field name="inTaxTotal"/>

  </grid>

  <!--
  DESIGN PATTERN:
  - Toolbar: Single most frequent action (Print)
  - Menubar: Less frequent batch operations (Validate, Merge)
  - Prompt: Confirmation for destructive/batch actions
  - Conditional items: Show only when feature enabled
  -->


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- PATTERN 5: Multiple Menus in Menubar -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <grid name="invoice-grid-multiple-menus" title="Invoices"
        model="com.axelor.apps.account.db.Invoice">

    <toolbar>
      <button name="printBtn" title="Print" icon="fa-print"
              onClick="action-invoice-method-show-invoice"/>
    </toolbar>

    <!-- PATTERN: Multiple menu groups for different action categories -->
    <menubar>
      <!-- Menu 1: Batch operations -->
      <menu name="invoiceBatchMenu" title="Batch" icon="fa-tasks" showTitle="true">
        <item name="validateBatchItem" title="Validate selected"
              action="action-invoice-method-mass-validation"
              prompt="Are you sure you want to validate all selected invoices ?"/>

        <item name="ventilateBatchItem" title="Ventilate selected"
              action="action-invoice-method-mass-ventilation"
              prompt="Are you sure you want to ventilate all selected invoices ?"/>

        <item name="cancelBatchItem" title="Cancel selected"
              action="action-invoice-method-mass-cancellation"
              prompt="Are you sure you want to cancel all selected invoices ?"/>
      </menu>

      <!-- Menu 2: Reports and exports -->
      <menu name="invoiceExportsMenu" title="Export" icon="fa-download" showTitle="true">
        <item name="exportExcelItem" title="Export to Excel"
              action="action-invoice-method-export-excel"/>

        <item name="exportPdfItem" title="Export to PDF"
              action="action-invoice-method-export-pdf"/>

        <item name="exportCsvItem" title="Export to CSV"
              action="action-invoice-method-export-csv"/>
      </menu>

      <!-- Menu 3: Tools -->
      <menu name="invoiceToolsMenu" title="Tools" icon="fa-wrench" showTitle="true">
        <item name="mergeInvoicesItem" title="Merge invoices"
              action="action-invoice-method-convert-selected-lines-to-merge-lines"/>

        <item name="seeInvoiceLinesItem" title="See invoice lines"
              action="action-customer-invoice-line-menu"/>

        <item name="recalculateTotalsItem" title="Recalculate totals"
              action="action-invoice-method-recalculate-totals"/>
      </menu>
    </menubar>

    <field name="invoiceId"/>
    <field name="statusSelect"/>
    <field name="inTaxTotal"/>

  </grid>

  <!--
  ORGANIZATION:
  - Group related actions in separate menus
  - Common groups:
    - Batch: Mass operations (validate, cancel, update)
    - Export: Different export formats (Excel, PDF, CSV)
    - Tools: Utilities (merge, recalculate, view details)
  - Use showTitle=true for clarity
  - Consistent icons per category (tasks, download, wrench)
  -->


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- PATTERN 6: Form with Menubar -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <form name="opportunity-form-menubar" title="Opportunity"
        model="com.axelor.apps.crm.db.Opportunity">

    <!-- PATTERN: Menubar in form for secondary actions -->
    <menubar>
      <menu name="opportunityToolsMenu" title="Tools" showTitle="true" icon="fa-wrench">
        <!-- PATTERN: Item with conditional module check -->
        <item name="convertIntoQuotationItem"
              if="__config__.app.isApp('sale')" if-module="axelor-sale"
              title="Create a quotation"
              action="save,action-sale-group-generate-sale-order"/>

        <!-- PATTERN: Item with save action chain -->
        <item title="Schedule Event"
              action="save,action-opportunity-view-schedule-event"/>

        <!-- PATTERN: Item with help text -->
        <item name="convertToCustomerItem" title="Convert to Customer"
              action="save,action-opportunity-method-convert-to-customer"
              help="Convert this opportunity's partner to a customer"/>
      </menu>
    </menubar>

    <panel name="mainPanel">
      <field name="name"/>
      <field name="amount"/>
      <field name="partner"/>
    </panel>

  </form>

  <!--
  FORM MENUBAR PATTERN:
  - Use for actions that don't fit in sidebars or panels
  - Common actions: Generate related records, conversions, wizards
  - Always use "save," prefix if action needs saved data
  - help attribute for tooltips on hover
  - if + if-module for cross-module features
  -->


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- PATTERN 7: Form with Multiple Menus in Menubar -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <form name="manuf-order-form-menubar" title="Manufacturing order"
        model="com.axelor.apps.production.db.ManufOrder">

    <!-- PATTERN: Three distinct menu groups -->
    <menubar>
      <!-- Menu 1: Reports -->
      <menu name="manufOrderReportsMenu" title="Reports"
            icon="fa-files-o" showTitle="true">
        <item name="printProductionProcessItem" title="Print Production Process"
              action="save,action-production-process-method-print"/>

        <item name="printWorkCenterLoadItem" title="Print Work Center Load"
              action="save,action-work-center-load-method-print"/>

        <item name="printBarcodeLabelsItem" title="Print Barcode Labels"
              action="save,action-manuf-order-method-print-barcode-labels"/>

        <item name="printCostSheetItem" title="Print Cost Sheet"
              action="save,action-cost-sheet-method-print"/>
      </menu>

      <!-- Menu 2: Tools -->
      <menu name="manufOrderToolsMenu" title="Tools"
            icon="fa-wrench" showTitle="true">
        <!-- PATTERN: Item with showIf (runtime condition) -->
        <item name="generateWasteItem" title="Generate Waste Declaration"
              action="save,action-manuf-order-method-generate-waste"
              showIf="statusSelect == 6"/>

        <item name="mergeOrdersItem" title="Merge with Other Orders"
              action="action-manuf-order-view-merge-wizard"/>

        <item name="splitOrderItem" title="Split Order"
              action="save,action-manuf-order-view-split-wizard"
              showIf="statusSelect &lt; 4"/>

        <item name="updateCostsItem" title="Update Costs"
              action="save,action-manuf-order-method-update-costs"/>
      </menu>

      <!-- Menu 3: More actions (icon only) -->
      <menu name="manufOrderMoreMenu" title="More"
            icon="fa-ellipsis-v" showTitle="false">
        <item name="duplicateItem" title="Duplicate Order"
              action="save,action-manuf-order-method-duplicate"/>

        <item name="archiveItem" title="Archive"
              action="action-manuf-order-method-archive"
              showIf="statusSelect >= 6"/>

        <item name="exportDataItem" title="Export Data"
              action="action-manuf-order-method-export-data"/>
      </menu>
    </menubar>

    <panel name="mainPanel">
      <field name="manufOrderSeq"/>
      <field name="product"/>
      <field name="statusSelect"/>
    </panel>

  </form>

  <!--
  ADVANCED PATTERN:
  - Reports menu: All print/export actions
  - Tools menu: Utilities and generators
  - More menu: Less common actions (showTitle=false for compact)
  - showIf: Runtime condition based on record state
  - Ellipsis icon (fa-ellipsis-v) for "More" actions
  -->


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- PATTERN 8: Toolbar with Conditional Buttons -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <grid name="opportunity-grid-conditional" title="Opportunities"
        model="com.axelor.apps.crm.db.Opportunity">

    <!-- PATTERN: Toolbar button with controller method call -->
    <toolbar>
      <button name="grabOpportunityBtn" icon="fa-suitcase" title="Take charge"
              help="Assign selected opportunities to me"
              onClick="com.axelor.apps.crm.web.OpportunityController:assignToMe"/>
    </toolbar>

    <field name="name"/>
    <field name="partner"/>
    <field name="amount"/>
    <field name="user"/>

  </grid>

  <!--
  PATTERN:
  - Toolbar button calling Java controller method
  - Syntax: "com.package.Controller:methodName"
  - help attribute for tooltip
  - Button operates on selected rows
  -->


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- PATTERN 9: Menu Items with Prompts and Conditions -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <grid name="sale-order-grid-advanced" title="Sale orders"
        model="com.axelor.apps.sale.db.SaleOrder">

    <menubar>
      <menu name="saleOrderActionsMenu" title="Actions" icon="fa-bolt" showTitle="true">
        <!-- PATTERN: Prompt with clear question -->
        <item name="confirmSelectedItem" title="Confirm selected orders"
              action="action-sale-order-method-confirm-selected"
              prompt="Are you sure you want to confirm all selected orders ?"/>

        <!-- PATTERN: Multiple conditions (if + showIf equivalent) -->
        <item name="generateInvoicesItem" title="Generate invoices"
              if="__config__.app.isApp('account')"
              action="action-sale-order-method-generate-invoices"
              prompt="Generate invoices for all selected orders ?"/>

        <!-- PATTERN: No prompt for non-destructive action -->
        <item name="exportOrdersItem" title="Export orders"
              action="action-sale-order-method-export-selected"/>

        <!-- PATTERN: Prompt for cancellation (destructive) -->
        <item name="cancelSelectedItem" title="Cancel selected orders"
              action="action-sale-order-method-cancel-selected"
              prompt="Are you sure you want to cancel all selected orders ? This action cannot be undone."/>
      </menu>
    </menubar>

    <field name="saleOrderSeq"/>
    <field name="statusSelect"/>
    <field name="inTaxTotal"/>

  </grid>

  <!--
  PROMPT USAGE:
  - Always use for destructive actions (delete, cancel, archive)
  - Use for batch operations affecting multiple records
  - Use for state changes (confirm, validate, finalize)
  - Skip for read-only actions (export, view, print)
  - Question format: "Are you sure...?" or "Do you want...?"
  - Warn about irreversibility: "This action cannot be undone."
  -->


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <!-- PATTERN 10: Icon-Only Menus (Compact Layout) -->
  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

  <grid name="partner-grid-compact" title="Partners"
        model="com.axelor.apps.base.db.Partner">

    <toolbar>
      <button name="printBtn" title="Print" icon="fa-print"
              onClick="action-partner-method-print"/>
    </toolbar>

    <!-- PATTERN: Icon-only menus for compact UI -->
    <menubar>
      <!-- Print menu (icon only) -->
      <menu name="printMenu" title="Print" icon="fa-print" showTitle="false">
        <item name="printLabelsItem" title="Print address labels"
              action="action-partner-method-print-labels"/>
        <item name="printCatalogItem" title="Print catalog"
              action="action-partner-method-print-catalog"/>
      </menu>

      <!-- Export menu (icon only) -->
      <menu name="exportMenu" title="Export" icon="fa-download" showTitle="false">
        <item name="exportExcelItem" title="Export to Excel"
              action="action-partner-method-export-excel"/>
        <item name="exportVCardItem" title="Export vCards"
              action="action-partner-method-export-vcard"/>
      </menu>

      <!-- Tools menu (icon only) -->
      <menu name="toolsMenu" title="Tools" icon="fa-wrench" showTitle="false">
        <item name="mergePartnersItem" title="Merge partners"
              action="action-partner-view-merge-wizard"/>
        <item name="deduplicateItem" title="Find duplicates"
              action="action-partner-view-deduplicate"/>
      </menu>

      <!-- More menu (icon only) -->
      <menu name="moreMenu" title="More" icon="fa-ellipsis-v" showTitle="false">
        <item name="archiveItem" title="Archive selected"
              action="action-partner-method-archive-selected"
              prompt="Are you sure you want to archive all selected partners ?"/>
      </menu>
    </menubar>

    <field name="fullName"/>
    <field name="emailAddress"/>
    <field name="isCustomer"/>
    <field name="isSupplier"/>

  </grid>

  <!--
  COMPACT LAYOUT PATTERN:
  - showTitle="false" for all menus
  - Shows only icons (saves horizontal space)
  - Use distinctive icons (print, download, wrench, ellipsis)
  - Items still show full title text
  - Good for grids with many menus (4+)
  - Mobile-friendly
  -->

</object-views>

<!--
KEY TAKEAWAYS:

1. **Toolbar vs Menubar**:
   - **Toolbar**: 1-4 most important actions (print, export, email)
   - **Menubar**: Secondary actions grouped by category (tools, batch, reports)
   - Can use both: Toolbar for primary, Menubar for secondary
   - Toolbar buttons always visible, Menubar actions in dropdowns

2. **Toolbar Design**:
   - Position: Top of grid/form
   - Button limit: 2-4 buttons (avoid clutter)
   - Priority: Left to right (most important first)
   - Icons: Font Awesome (fa-print, fa-envelope, fa-download)
   - title: Button text or tooltip
   - onClick: Action or action chain

3. **Menubar Design**:
   - Position: Top of grid/form (below toolbar if both present)
   - Structure: <menubar> > <menu> > <item>
   - Menu: Dropdown group with title and icon
   - Item: Individual action within menu
   - Menus: 2-5 recommended (batch, export, tools, reports, more)

4. **Menu Attributes**:
   - **name**: Unique identifier
   - **title**: Display text (menu label)
   - **icon**: Font Awesome icon (fa-wrench, fa-tasks, fa-download)
   - **showTitle**: true (show text+icon) or false (icon only)
   - showTitle=true: Good for clarity (2-3 menus)
   - showTitle=false: Compact layout (4+ menus)

5. **Item Attributes**:
   - **name**: Unique identifier (optional)
   - **title**: Display text (action label)
   - **action**: Action to execute (comma-separated chain)
   - **prompt**: Confirmation dialog text
   - **if**: Compile-time condition (module check)
   - **if-module**: Module dependency check
   - **showIf**: Runtime condition (field values)
   - **help**: Tooltip text (on hover)

6. **Action Patterns**:
   - Simple: "action-method-name"
   - With save: "save,action-method-name"
   - Chain: "save,action1,action2,action3"
   - Controller: "com.package.Controller:methodName"
   - View: "action-view-name"

7. **Prompt Usage**:
   - Use for: Destructive actions, batch operations, state changes
   - Skip for: Exports, prints, view opens (non-destructive)
   - Format: Clear question ("Are you sure...?")
   - Warning: Add "This action cannot be undone" for irreversible actions
   - Buttons: OK (executes) / Cancel (stops)

8. **Conditional Visibility**:
   - **if**: Module or app config check (compile-time)
     - Example: if="__config__.app.isApp('sale')"
     - Example: if="__user__.hasRole('admin')"
   - **if-module**: Module installed check
     - Example: if-module="axelor-sale"
   - **showIf**: Record state check (runtime)
     - Example: showIf="statusSelect == 3"
     - Example: showIf="statusSelect &lt; 4 &amp;&amp; !invoiced"
   - Can combine: if + if-module, if + showIf

9. **Icon Selection**:
   - **Print/Reports**: fa-print, fa-files-o, fa-file-pdf-o
   - **Export**: fa-download, fa-file-excel-o, fa-database
   - **Tools**: fa-wrench, fa-cog, fa-cogs
   - **Actions**: fa-bolt, fa-flash, fa-play
   - **Batch**: fa-tasks, fa-list-ul
   - **More**: fa-ellipsis-v (vertical), fa-ellipsis-h (horizontal)
   - **Email**: fa-envelope, fa-envelope-o
   - **Create**: fa-plus, fa-plus-circle
   - Use consistent icons across application

10. **Menu Organization**:
    - **Batch menu**: Mass operations (validate all, cancel all, update all)
    - **Export menu**: Different formats (Excel, PDF, CSV)
    - **Reports menu**: Print operations (documents, labels, lists)
    - **Tools menu**: Utilities (merge, split, calculate, generate)
    - **More menu**: Uncommon actions (duplicate, archive, advanced)

11. **Compact Layout** (Icon-Only):
    - Set showTitle="false" on all menus
    - Shows only icons (saves space)
    - Good for: Mobile, narrow screens, many menus (4+)
    - Choose distinctive icons
    - Items still show full title text

12. **Best Practices**:
    - Toolbar: 1 button ideal, max 4
    - Menubar: 2-3 menus optimal, max 5
    - Items per menu: 3-7 optimal, max 10
    - Save first: Use "save," prefix for actions needing data
    - Prompt: Always for destructive/batch actions
    - Icons: Consistent across similar actions
    - Naming: descriptive (printBtn, exportExcelItem)
    - Help text: Add for non-obvious actions
    - Grouping: Related actions in same menu

13. **Performance**:
    - Toolbar buttons: Always loaded (keep few)
    - Menubar items: Loaded on menu click (can have more)
    - Conditional items: Evaluated on menu open
    - Controller methods: Good for complex logic
    - Action chains: Avoid too many steps (max 3-4)

14. **Common Mistakes**:
    - Too many toolbar buttons (>4) - use menubar instead
    - No prompts for destructive actions - users may click by accident
    - Forgetting "save," prefix - action fails without data
    - showTitle=true with many menus - too wide
    - Generic icons (fa-star) - use semantic icons
    - No grouping - random item order

15. **Form vs Grid Usage**:
    - **Grid toolbar**: Batch actions on selected rows
    - **Grid menubar**: Tools for multiple records
    - **Form menubar**: Actions related to current record
    - **Form toolbar**: Rare (use sidebar buttons instead)
    - Grid: More likely to have toolbar + menubar
    - Form: Typically only menubar

16. **Mobile Considerations**:
    - Icon-only menus (showTitle=false)
    - Fewer menus (max 3-4 on mobile)
    - Clear icons (recognizable at small size)
    - Short menu titles (if shown)
    - Avoid long action chains (performance)

17. **Integration Patterns**:
    - Toolbar + Menubar: Primary action in toolbar, rest in menubar
    - Multiple menus: Group by action type (batch, export, tools)
    - Conditional items: Show/hide based on state or modules
    - Prompts: Confirm before executing
    - Save chains: Ensure data persisted before action
    - Controller methods: Complex logic in Java
-->
